{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297891","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297891","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029789101:1":{"text":"엘로나가 새로운 나무를 마음에 들어 하는군요.","source_cn":"艾洛娜很喜欢这棵树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC621C2DD3A5CAC9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029789102:1":{"text":"그래서 아마 며칠 더 여기에 머물 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"所以，我大概会在这里多留几天吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8965E75CFF5DCDFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1029789102":{"text":"그래서 아마 며칠 더 여기에 머물 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"所以，我大概会在这里多留几天吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8965E75CFF5DCDFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029789103:1":{"text":"라이카 일행이 몇 번 놀러온 적이 있다며, 신경쓰지 말고 즐기다 오라 하더군요.","source_cn":"莱卡她们此前来玩过几次，所以发来风讯说让我不用在意好好玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AA0F97124A5123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029789104:1":{"text":"저도 마침 거의 쉬어본 적이 없으니까요.","source_cn":"毕竟我几乎不怎么休假。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31BF1DB99C7DE3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document